run 05-bento-dark "Website hero section screenshot, desktop 16:9. Dark pine green background. A modern bento grid of six rounded rectangular cards of different sizes with subtle 1px translucent cream borders and soft inner glows. Large top-left card holds the headline in cream serif reading 'Your patients send voice notes. Sanad listens and books them.' with a gold button reading 'Book a demo'. Tall right card holds a realistic WhatsApp chat mockup with a voice note waveform and Arabic reply bubbles. Small card shows a gold audio waveform and the label 'Voice notes, understood'. Small card shows a big tabular number '≈ AED 25,000' with the caption 'left unrecovered, monthly — illustrative'. Small card shows a calendar tile with a green check and the label 'Booked · tagged bot-originated'. Small card shows a UAE flag glyph and the label 'Patient data stays in the UAE'. Crisp, modern, dashboard-like, premium. $BRAND"

